        <body>
            <div xml:id="d520-a1">

                <pb facs="d520-2" n="2" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/d520-2"/>


                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian" when="1960-01-06"
                            >January 6, 1960</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d520-3" n="3" type="facsimile" xml:id="d520-3"/>
                <p>Mr. Dillon will initiate preparation of 2 memos—</p>
                <p>—1 fr Sec Def to Sec State “after [illegible in the original]</p>
                <p>a Post not responsive to directive—[illegible in the original]</p>
                <p>b Doesn’t agree with judgments + conclusions</p>
                <p>—2 fr Sec State to Eaton</p>
                <p>—refer advisory study to be available to Eaton in prep of [illegible in the
                    original]</p>
                <p>Bring Eaton pm before NSC—[illegible in the original]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
